=== PARITY (vs web JourneyDetailsPanel.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> useTranslation only. The web source is a pure presentational leaf: prop
    { drive: DriveDetail }. The native surface binds the P1/S8 JourneyDetailsSource carrying the parent's drive
    snapshot + the display context the web pulls from hooks at render (the `DateTime in="vehicle"` IANA timezone
    + the `fmtNumber` locale + global precision=2). The view performs NO HTTP.
  Projection -> 1:1 port of the web inline branches. Primary text per endpoint: truthy address -> address;
    else `lat && lon` (BOTH non-nil AND non-zero, JS truthiness) -> "fmtNumber(lat,2)°N|S, fmtNumber(abs(lon),2)°E|W"
    rendered monospaced (web font-mono); else the fallback. Web QUIRKS reproduced verbatim + unit-tested:
    (a) latitude is NOT Math.abs'd (keeps its sign: e.g. "-33.87°S"), only longitude is abs'd;
    (b) 0 / nil short-circuits the coordinate to the address fallback; (c) battery "{pct ?? '?'}%";
    (d) destination fallback = finished (endTs present) -> "No address data", unfinished -> "In progress";
    (e) destination timestamp = endTs ? formatted : "In progress". Verified by executed XCTest (24/24).
  Composition -> web header `<h3>` (Navigation glyph, text-cyan -> Color.TS.accent) + "Journey Details";
    web `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2` -> LazyVGrid(.adaptive minimum 240); Start cell (MapPin/green ->
    mappin.circle.fill / Color.TS.statusSuccess) + Destination cell (Flag/red -> flag.fill /
    Color.TS.statusDanger). Per cell: bold primary (text-primary), muted timestamp (text-muted), secondary
    battery (text-secondary). Whole panel wrapped in TSFadeIn (web <FadeIn>).
  Shared components -> @/components/ui/GlassPanel -> TSGlassPanel; @/components/motion/FadeIn -> TSFadeIn;
    @/components/data-display DateTime -> Date.FormatStyle(date:.abbreviated, time:.shortened) in the vehicle tz +
    locale (Apple-HIG idiomatic peer of the web year/month-short/day + hour/minute); fmtNumber -> NumberFormatter
    (.decimal, grouping, min=max fraction=2, locale). Skeleton chrome -> TSSkeleton. Compiled against the REAL
